records.rationale:
In `packages/app-store/googlecalendar/lib/CalendarService.ts`, `createEvent` now selects the calendar by matching `calEventRaw.destinationCalendar` entries against the passed `credentialId`:

```ts
const selectedCalendar = calEventRaw.destinationCalendar?.find(
  (cal) => cal.credentialId === credentialId
)?.externalId;
...
calendarId: selectedCalendar || "primary",
```

